# Architecture

- This is Next.js App Router with breaking changes vs older Next — read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before non-trivial APIs.
- Server-first: RSC by default; Client Components only for forms, widgets, interactive UI.
- Dashboard mutations → **Server Actions** (no internal REST CRUD for app mutations).
- Route Handlers only for: streaming, PDF download, webhooks, similar edge cases.
- Validate inputs with Zod on server boundaries.
- Follow existing folder conventions; do not introduce new architectural patterns without updating Tech docs.
- Multi-tenant: every business query/mutation is scoped by `clinic_id`.
